[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8942.63, "timestamp": "02:29:02", "text": "所以，他先是试图向我们开枪。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8945.51, "timestamp": "02:29:05", "text": "没用。所以，他试图撞我们。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8947.75, "timestamp": "02:29:07", "text": "你撞向对方，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8950.15, "timestamp": "02:29:10", "text": "不会显示为队友击杀。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8963.79, "timestamp": "02:29:23", "text": "在哪里？哦好的。我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8972.469, "timestamp": "02:29:32", "text": "尼姆罗德。尼姆罗德是一个非常标志性的人物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8975.99, "timestamp": "02:29:35", "text": "第一个，你知道，半新世纪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8978.309, "timestamp": "02:29:38", "text": "英国飞机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8999.03, "timestamp": "02:29:59", "text": "他。团队合作很棒。我们已经赢了。"}]